{"name":"Mishtan City of the Dead","status":"ok","title":"Mishtan","pageId":48824,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mishtan</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> Village<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Vale\" title=\"Great Vale\">Great Vale</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p122_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Osiris\" title=\"Osiris\">Osiris</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Preceptual government</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Precept</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"allegiances\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Allegiances</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Church of Osiris (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2h1cmNoX29mX09zaXJpcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Church of Osiris</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000–30,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357&#160;DR</a><br>6,459&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Precept</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temis\" title=\"Temis\">Temis</a>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Mishtan\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Mishtan\">Inhabitants of  Mishtan</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Mishtan\" title=\"Category:Locations in Mishtan\">Locations in  Mishtan</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Mishtan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9NaXNodGFuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Organizations in  Mishtan</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Mishtan&DPL_cat2=Settlements&action=purge\">Settlements  in  Mishtan</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Mishtan&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Mishtan</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Events in Mishtan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX01pc2h0YW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Events in  Mishtan</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Mishtan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6Rm9vZF9hbmRfZHJpbmtfZnJvbV9NaXNodGFuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Food and drink from  Mishtan</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Items from Mishtan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9NaXNodGFuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Items from  Mishtan</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Mishtan</b> was one of many villages within the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Vale\" title=\"Great Vale\">Great Vale</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> later deemed to be a small city,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and was one of the nation's sixteen preceptual governments.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It stood out from others due to being one of the centers of <a href=\"/wiki/Osiris\" title=\"Osiris\">Osiris</a> worship in Mulhorand<sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p122_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and because it was the gateway to the <a href=\"/wiki/Land_of_the_Dead\" title=\"Land of the Dead\">Land of the Dead</a>—the resting place of Mulhorand's <a href=\"/wiki/Pharaoh\" title=\"Pharaoh\">pharaohs</a> and their families.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mishtan?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mishtan had a preceptual government, which ruled over both the city and the nearby Land of the Dead.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was largely governed by the local <span class=\"new\" title=\"Church of Osiris (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2h1cmNoX29mX09zaXJpcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Osiran</span> clergy,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p122_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> of the temple known as the <a href=\"/wiki/Gateway_to_the_Afterworld\" title=\"Gateway to the Afterworld\">Gateway to the Afterworld</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p122_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Its ruler in the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, as recommended to the vizier by the Osiran priesthood, was the Precept <a href=\"/wiki/Temis\" title=\"Temis\">Temis</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_4-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mishtan?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tombs for the pharaohs and other construction projects were a never-ending occurrence in Mishtan,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> as the Osiran clergy were in charge of the Land of the Dead.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-P&P-p122_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&P-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> During the flood season, the village was typically teeming with artisans, masons, and <a href=\"/wiki/Slavery\" title=\"Slavery\">slaves</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mishtan?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mishtan's regular population in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a> was 2,000, but could easily swell to 30,000 if a large construction project was taking place. These surplus workers would dwell within makeshift homes surrounding Mishtan.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_2-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> By <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, the stable population of Mishtan was around 6,459.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"A